      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "R6nugsNhCADdUeYd",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!zSkwEUUtkNGhfXun.R6nugsNhCADdUeYd",
      "name": "Storyteller Notes",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p><strong>Structure:</strong> an office building (@UUID[JournalEntry.y8Ao3xEHH3W11EJe]{Preston Gale}&#39;s office is on the third floor), a windowless data center with three levels of security, and a testing room where the ANOMALY model is trained.</p>\n<p><strong>Security:</strong> mortal guards; at night, four of Gale&#39;s ghouls (@UUID[Actor.BzNGxOAK3F6Uo56T]{Halloway's Security Ghouls}). There are ANOMALY cameras at the entrances, so any Kindred who comes in through the front door gets logged as a “cold subject” (Thermometer +1: <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-termometro\" data-sbn-termometro=\"+1\" data-motivo=\"Kindred logged as a “cold subject” at Gale Sentinel\"><span class=\"sbn-termometro-cambio\">+1</span> <span class=\"sbn-termometro-motivo\">Kindred logged as a “cold subject” at Gale Sentinel</span></button>), unless @UUID[JournalEntry.PBJeE9T9n0BjB6ag]{Ezra} or someone with Technology 3 disables the module first.</p>\n<p><strong>Scenes:</strong> @UUID[JournalEntry.5hwXPdn0tUJ3NaKZ.JournalEntryPage.wIpc0OR2nQf7WDFO]{A1-E05 · The City's Eyes} and @UUID[JournalEntry.C7cxKf7kcAELzuJ1.JournalEntryPage.EjJ0vfVBCjTTb0QV]{A3-E02 · The Data Center}.</p>\n<p><strong>Clues:</strong> <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-pista\" data-sbn-pista=\"P-06\"><span class=\"sbn-pista-id\">P-06</span> <span class=\"sbn-pista-nombre\">Unlogged Gale Sentinel Data Request</span></button>, <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-pista\" data-sbn-pista=\"P-10\"><span class=\"sbn-pista-id\">P-10</span> <span class=\"sbn-pista-nombre\">SEA-0411 Shipments / DOC-07</span></button>, <button type=\"button\" class=\"sbn-pista\" data-sbn-pista=\"P-11\"><span class=\"sbn-pista-id\">P-11</span> <span class=\"sbn-pista-nombre\">Gale&#39;s Signature</span></button>, @UUID[JournalEntry.YhmNvLugMfCZezEH]{Gale Sentinel: 2027 Product Roadmap, Confidential}.</p>\n"
      },
